1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Some work is ready for a prompt.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:07,620
When you know what you're asking, the chat box is a fine tool. Type it, send it, get to work.

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:12,160
But some work starts earlier — while the question is still taking shape.

4
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:19,910
On a canvas, meaning can live in where things sit, what changed, what was crossed out — and what was said beside it.

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,640
A better model cannot recover context that was never included.
